SUMMARY:Special Event: Tom Filine aka Angry Gym Teacher
LOCATION:Portland
DESCRIPTION:Tom Filline's path to the stage has been anything but ordinary.
  A former theater kid turned professional wrestler turned stand up comedian
 \, Tom eventually found his true calling combining the two worlds he loved:
  performing and teaching. He trained at The Second City in Chicago before b
 ecoming a professional stand-up comedian and keynote speaker\, and today he
 adlines top comedy clubs while also touring internationally with the Bored 
 Teachers Comedy Tour. As a PE teacher by day\, Tom built a social media bra
 nd—The Angry Gym Teacher—that has grown to over 500k followers\, turnin
 g the everyday chaos of the gymnasium into comedy gold. Whether he's on sta
 ge\, in the gym\, or behind a podium\, Tom brings the same energy: honest\,
  hilarious\, and unmistakably himself.\n\nCouple's Package includes:\n\n- 2
  premium seats\n- $90 food & beverage credit ($45 per person)\n- Gratuity\n
 - Ticket Protection\n\nManagement reserves the right to prevent customers f
 rom entering the facility who they deem disruptive or dangerous to other pa
 trons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/special-event
 -tom-filine-aka-angry-gym-teacher/
